  triage:description "The sprint doc (sprint-AY.3-herdr-endpoint-doctor-config.md:82-88,106-110,135,470-473) and phase-ay-plan.md:994-999 require boundaries/atm-core/herdr-endpoint-doctor.toml and boundaries/atm-herdr/herdr-process-adapter.toml to land as the first commit. On feature/ay3 (52c1f2112..45701a81e, 19 commits) commit 1 is 44007297f (core contracts) and the TOML lands at commit 9 (ed94c1690). Verified by fenix: the order is arch-ctm's authoring order (author timestamps monotonic); gh stack sync force-pushes on the PR predate commits 4-19 and did not reorder. Content of the TOML is correct (boundary-guard). Process finding awaiting Rand's ruling: history rewrite vs recorded P-E(a)/A2 amendment." ;
